@startuml DiagramaImplantacao
skinparam dpi 130
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 6
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFBEB
skinparam NoteBorderColor #D97706
skinparam NodeBorderColor #475569
skinparam NodeBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam ArtifactBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArtifactBorderColor #2563EB
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #EDE9FE
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #7C3AED
skinparam DatabaseBackgroundColor #FFEDD5
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #B45309
skinparam CloudBorderColor #64748B
top to bottom direction
title Diagrama de Implantação — TOKEN (Release 2, nuvem: Vercel + Render)

node "Dispositivo do usuário\n<<device>>\n(computador ou celular)" as DEV {
  node "Navegador web\n<<executionEnvironment>>" as NAV {
    artifact "SPA React 19\n(index.html + assets JS/CSS)" as SPA_RT
  }
}

cloud "Vercel" as VERCEL {
  node "Vercel Edge Network (CDN)\n<<executionEnvironment>>" as EDGE {
    artifact "frontend/dist\n(build do Vite)" as DIST
    artifact "vercel.json\n<<deployment spec>>\nrewrite /api/* → Render\nfallback /* → index.html" as VJSON
  }
}

cloud "Render (região Virginia, EUA)" as RENDER {
  node "Web Service token-moeda-estudantil\n<<device>> instância Free · 512 MB" as WEB {
    node "Contêiner Docker\n<<executionEnvironment>>\neclipse-temurin:21-jre" as CONT {
      artifact "token-1.0.0.jar\n(Spring Boot 3.5 + Tomcat embutido)\nSPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=prod" as JAR {
        component "Controllers REST\n+ AutenticacaoInterceptor" as C_CTRL
        component "Services\n(Autenticacao, Aluno, Empresa,\nProfessor, Vantagem, Resgate,\nTransacaoMoeda, NotificacaoEmail)" as C_SERV
        component "Repositories\n(Spring Data JPA / Hibernate)" as C_REPO
      }
    }
  }
  node "Render PostgreSQL 16\n<<device>> instância Free" as PGNODE {
    database "tokendb\n(tabelas do modelo ER)" as DB
  }
}

node "Servidor SMTP externo\n<<device>>\n(Mailtrap / Brevo)" as SMTP

node "GitHub\n<<device>>\nrepositório TOKEN (branch main)" as GH

NAV --> EDGE : HTTPS 443\nGET páginas e assets
NAV --> EDGE : HTTPS 443 · /api/** (JSON, multipart)\ncookie JSESSIONID (mesma origem)
EDGE --> CONT : HTTPS 443 · proxy reverso (rewrite)\n/api/** → https://token-moeda-estudantil.onrender.com
C_CTRL --> C_SERV
C_SERV --> C_REPO
C_REPO --> DB : JDBC / TCP 5432\n(rede privada do Render)
C_SERV ..> SMTP : SMTP 2525 + STARTTLS\n(@Async, após o commit)
GH ..> VERCEL : push → build e deploy\nautomático (Root: frontend/)
GH ..> RENDER : push → docker build\n(render.yaml + Dockerfile)

note bottom of EDGE
  O navegador só conversa com o domínio do Vercel.
  O rewrite repassa /api/** ao Render no servidor,
  então o cookie de sessão é de primeira parte
  (sem CORS e sem cookie de terceiros).
end note

note bottom of WEB
  O plano gratuito hiberna após 15 min sem uso;
  a primeira requisição seguinte leva ~1 min.
  Health check: GET /api/instituicoes
end note
@enduml
